## Configuration sources

| Source | Path | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| Sample template | `configuration.lua.sample` | Committed |
| Local secrets | `configuration.lua` | **Gitignored** |
| On-device overrides | `ankikooai_settings.json` | In KOReader data dir; wins after first save |

